# docker/docker: CVE-2026-34040 (AuthZ bypass) - fixed in v29.3.1, but that version
# changed module path to github.com/moby/moby/v2 (incompatible API restructuring).
# Panel uses docker/docker as a client SDK, not as a daemon, so this is not exploitable.
CVE-2026-34040

# nwaples/rardecode: CVE-2025-11579 / GHSA-rwvp-r38j-9rgg (DoS via large RAR dictionary) - fixed in v2.2.0,
# but archiver/v3 imports the v1 path; project never extracts RAR files, only ZIP/TarGz.
CVE-2025-11579

# docker/docker: CVE-2026-41568 / GHSA-vp62-88p7-qqf5 (race condition in docker cp) - fixed in v29.3.1,
# but that version changed module path to github.com/moby/moby/v2. Panel uses docker/docker as client SDK.
CVE-2026-41568
